      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TROUBLE IN HEAVEN (8) modest result two starts ago at this track then again failed to threaten at her latest appearance over 1720m at Young, beaten 30 metres into seventh after being handy in the run. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw. Primary contender if anywhere near her best. STIPULATING (1) had been building to a win and it arrived last time out, scoring by 6 metres over 1720m at Young after coming from a long way back. Has the benefit of a good draw. Meets a similar line up so he is capable of taking this out. FREASON (7) is on the radar after his last-start fifth over 1740m at this track two weeks ago. ARMA THE GREAT (3) was unplaced two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he copped a check and broke, finishing 8 metres away in sixth over 1720m at Young. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this much better draw. Live chance in a similar assignment.",
